WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.650
Just the same landscape over and over again.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.150
When will it end?

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.680
We'll be there in a few hours.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.960
Russia, huh? I can't wait to see what
kinds of Bladers we'll be up against!

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.990
I've never been to Russia before.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:05.260
As the winning team in the B Block of the World Championships,

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.480
they should have fought plenty of battles, so...

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.680
Then why don't we have any info on 'em?

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:16.080
The Russian team has won
all their battles instantaneously.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.520
They haven't given any chance to collect data.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:20.220
<i>Wow</i>, in an instant?

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.420
Yes. They're overwhelmingly powerful.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:25.780
Their members, Yuri, Sergei, Boris, and Ivan...

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:28.040
They haven't lost a single match.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.290
Now I wanna battle the Russian team!

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.880
I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:32.890
Yeah, it's exciting!
I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:34.810
Yeah, it's exciting!

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:36.170
Yes!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.200
I can't wait to collect all this data!

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.410
Kai, what about you?

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.270
Just hearing about the Russian
team gets you fired up, right?

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:44.810
Right?!

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.850
They're an awesome team!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:49.760
I'm so excited!

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:51.310
Yeah, I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.320
The Final Site, Russia

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.670
I'm first!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.840
I'll go on ahead!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.330
Takao, hold on!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.860
See ya later!

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.720
Here we are, Russia!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.870
What's with <i>this</i> weirdo?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.560
It's a bit cold...

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.590
Cold! Why is it so freakin' cold?

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.960
That's why I told you to wait.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.010
You'll catch a cold!

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.840
Russia sure is freezing...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.000
Moscow is further north
than Hokkaido, you know.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:08.810
In the midst of winter, it can
go down to -10 degrees Celsius!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:12.350
It's your own fault for being so rash.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.680
He's right.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.810
I get it. Let's just head back to the hotel and warm up.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.820
I hope he won't be getting sick...

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.230
Will he be alright?

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.830
We don't have to worry about him.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.830
Yeah, I can't imagine a cold taking Takao out!

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:32.580
C'mon, hurry up and move!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.910
Are we at the hotel yet?

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.740
It is unusual that we haven't reached it yet.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.230
Wonder if we're lost?

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.140
Well? Can you make sense of it?

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.040
Yeah.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.800
I'm so hungry I can't move...

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.680
Let's find something to eat!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.920
Don't be such a brat.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.200
Brat! Brat!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.040
We're keeping on.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.050
If you keep standing around, you'll freeze for real!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.130
What's their problem?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.250
Wait up!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:38.030
So energetic!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:41.240
Russia <i>did</i> win the World
Championships' B Block. after all!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:56.170
Alright!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.070
They don't look too friendly.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.370
Do they not get many tourists around here?

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.370
Okay...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.840
How about we show that we're Bladers, just like them?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.980
You boys are...

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.400
from the BBA Team, aren't you?

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.770
I am Volkov. I'm in charge here.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:23.530
So, how about we take a look inside?

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:28.560
To be able to speak with <i>the</i> BBA Team...

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.410
It'll be a good experience
for them, as Beybladers.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.960
It's about time for lunch,

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.180
so let's chat while we eat.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.130
Now then, after you.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.800
Did he say lunch?! Let's go!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.030
Shall we take him up on his offer?

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:51.660
Sure.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.690
<i>Lucky</i> us!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:54.770
Dig in!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.820
Wolves Monastery

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.250
Volkov...

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:06.820
The Abbey...

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.790
Where have I heard this before?

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.680
So tasty. Pirozhki's the best!

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:20.240
The borscht was quite exquisite!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:24.760
And I enjoyed speaking with you all.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.760
the next drill!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:31.770
- Shoot!
- Shoot!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.010
- Shoot!
- Shoot!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.360
These kids are training here
to become our representatives

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.570
in the next World Tournament.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.150
They're excellent Bladers.

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:46.140
In Russia, becoming a first-class Beyblader

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.240
is the dream of many children.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:52.650
I seek to do what little I can to help them,

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.930
so I have opened up the abbey for them to use.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.560
How wonderful!

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.040
Absolutely amazing!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.960
Wow, they aren't even taking breaks.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.570
What do you think, Takao-kun?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.200
How about some exercise after your meal?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.440
Would you like to go hand-to-hand

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.960
with one of the children here?

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.220
Hand... to hand?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:16.600
Yeah?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.140
A practice match, yes?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:21.500
Indeed.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:24.020
After that lunch, I could totally use it.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:25.020
Let's do it!

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.720
Thank you very much.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:30.040
Then let's have it in the
Beyblade Hall over there.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.040
Line up, children!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.370
Please be honored.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.590
Takao-kun, a member of the
very BBA that's made it to the finals,

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:48.030
has offered to bestow his
talent unto you in a match.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.540
Mm-hm!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.370
The mood has changed entirely...

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.340
You'd be correct.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.420
Now then...

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.390
Who dares to challenge him?

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.360
Zangiev.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.960
Won't you try and battle him?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.630
If, perhaps, you are victorious...

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.660
I'll consider putting
you in a higher class.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:30.170
So, what will it be?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.660
Zangiev.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:39.890
I'll do it.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.550
Very well.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.100
Follow me, then.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.980
I'll introduce you to Takao-kun.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.830
Nice to meet'cha.
Let's have a good one!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.370
What's that?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:03.620
I will not shake hands.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:04.960
You are my enemy.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:07.170
Enemy?

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:11.420
As long as we are in battle, we are enemies.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.330
It's only a practice match!

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:14.960
No need to get serious.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.420
Right?

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.520
No, take a look.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.740
Kinda awkward...

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:31.380
We do not Beyblade for fun.

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.700
Beyblade is our life!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.960
What's these kids' problem?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.030
Here is the stadium.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:30.060
Now, Takao-kun, please prepare.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.080
Zangief.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.450
Get ready.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:33.600
Yes, sir.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.310
Uncomfortable, isn't it?

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:38.980
I agree...

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.910
Come on!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.540
It's the intensity that comes with a battle.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.900
They're scared of us
because we're the BBA Team.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.100
Is that right?

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:47.940
Huh?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.430
They're acting unusual, that's for sure.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:00.670
Kai.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:01.920
Is there a problem?

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.170
No.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.820
Sorry to make you wait.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.750
L-Look at the size of that thing!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.850
That's clearly violating regulations!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.100
This is my shooter.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.310
His <i>shooter</i>?

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:18.340
That thing?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.850
Are you ready for this?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.710
Yeah.

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:25.340
I wonder what kind of attacks it'll use?

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.470
Are the four of you ready?

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.170
Keep your eyes glued to the battle.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.360
--Yes.
--Yes.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.780
Are you ready?

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.570
Three!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:40.690
Two!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.410
One!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.070
Go Shoot!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:57.740
That's a..!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.090
Yes!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.360
A traditional craft in our country.

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.410
Derived from the Matryoshka!

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:05.510
The Matryoshka Shoot!

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.780
Its rotational speed increases
as each layer breaks away!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.740
Incredible! What incredible rotational speed!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.700
You're not half bad!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:23.320
Dragoon...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.150
is not as impressive as I thought.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.530
What?!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:31.510
Dragoon's attack power stems
from its intense rotational velocity.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.580
My Matryoshka does the exact opposite.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.550
I increase my defense through spin speed.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.160
W-Wow!

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.100
Its endurance and defensive
power far exceed Draciel's!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.560
This is no time to be impressed.

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.230
If I'm up against an endurance type,

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.710
I can't drag the battle out!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.710
There is no escape.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.530
Now all that's left is time.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.020
How long can you last?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.500
Time to put an end to this.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.920
What should I do?

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:28.640
That's...

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.680
Dragoon is all out of power!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.580
I am victorious!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.240
At this rate, Matryoshka will have the advantage!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:56.790
Kinomiya!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:00.160
Remember..!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.250
The battle between Max and I
in the Japanese tournament.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.120
I see!

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.720
Dragoon spins in reverse.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.220
So...

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:31.420
Crazy talk!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:34.400
Dragoon is an attack-type!
It's different from Draciel!

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.580
I have no other choice.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.670
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.450
Nothing you do can save you!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.660
Now, Dragoon!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.130
Back then, Draciel was on the bottom...

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.120
It's the reverse!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.020
Oh, I don't even need to get under him.

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:17.580
I just have to focus on his spin power.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:20.840
What?!

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.460
Let's do it!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:26.040
Phantom Hurricane!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.550
Hang in there, Matryoshka!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.400
Yes! Now finish the job!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:55.150
I expected no less from the BBA's own Takao-kun.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.360
You win.

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:59.330
Nah, it was a real great match!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.150
Right?

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.410
- Yay!
- Yes!

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.630
Zangiev.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:06.400
Unfortunately, you lose.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.420
I didn't think you'd be such a disappointment.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.960
I gave you so much special treatment, too.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.600
Please, wait!

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.610
I just let my guard down a little...

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.460
How pathetic.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.090
Let go.

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:49.860
What's this?

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.220
Volkov-sama, I beg of you!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.850
I... I won't lose again!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.600
Please!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.570
Give me another chance!

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:04.330
Spare me your excuses.

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:09.360
Help me! I beg of you, please help me!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.300
Stop it!

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:15.190
What do you think you're doing?!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.210
When it comes to Beyblade,
fun is what's most important.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:20.900
It's not about winning and losing!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.120
He's right! Let Zangiev go!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.400
Nonsense. What strange things you say.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:34.080
All you're saying is that none of you
have the resolve to risk your life for Beyblade.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.060
Volkov-sama, please!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:46.230
I won't... I won't lose again..!

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.770
You're pathetic!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.960
Volkov-sama!

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:57.310
Please help me!

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:06.380
Now, I believe you'd best be on your way.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.870
If you would follow me to the entrance...

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:11.420
What's gonna happen to Zangief?!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.880
Kinomiya...

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.770
We should follow his instructions.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.010
Kai, you....

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:26.590
Your friend speaks the truth.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.820
Isn't that right, Kai-kun?

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.170
Kai...

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.000
Takao...

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:00.600
Let's head on back.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:01.410
Come on...

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.410
No! I can't let this slide!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.330
Takao...

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.530
What was with that crap?!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.380
I don't get them!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.740
No point in waiting around.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.210
For now, let's go on back to our hotel.

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.630
The Professor is right.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:48.730
We'll freeze.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:50.720
I agree.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:52.120
Yeah.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.390
We can't do anything.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.210
I...

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.280
Please help me!

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:15.020
I...

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:17.780
I know this place!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:55.010 --> 00:22:58.520
Preview

00:22:58.900 --> 00:23:04.050
According to my analysis, Kai has been
acting strange ever since we visited that abbey.

00:23:04.050 --> 00:23:09.010
What kind of relationship does Kai have with that abbey?

00:23:09.010 --> 00:23:14.530
Well, if it isn't the American and Chinese teams!

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.050
What brings you here?

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:19.560
Next Time: The Door to Unpleasant Memories.

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:21.290
Mysteries, mysteries, mysteries!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:24.830
So many mysteries it turns my head into pirozhki!
